              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "Table 9.2 Nature, position and relative size of the image formed by a convex mirror"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "table_body",
              "index": 10,
              "bbox": [
                0.102,
                0.59,
                0.922,
                0.726
              ],
              "image_path": "images/page_7_table_10.jpg",
              "content": "<table><tbody><tr><td>Position of the</td><td>Position of the</td><td>Size of the</td><td>Nature of the</td></tr><tr><td>object</td><td>image</td><td>image</td><td>image</td></tr><tr><td>At infinity</td><td>At the focus F, behind the mirror</td><td>Highly diminished, point-sized</td><td>Virtual and erect</td></tr><tr><td>Between infinity</td><td>Between P and F,</td><td>Diminished</td><td>Virtual and erect</td></tr><tr><td>and the pole P of</td><td>behind the mirror</td><td></td><td></td></tr><tr><td>the mirror</td><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr></tbody></table>"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 11,
          "bbox": [
            0.098,
            0.732,
            0.724,
            0.783
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "You have so far studied the image formation by a plane mirror, a concave mirror and a convex mirror. Which of these mirrors will give the full image of a large object? Let us explore through an Activity.",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 12,
          "bbox": [
            0.143,
            0.793,
            0.298,
            0.815
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Activity 9.6"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 13,
          "bbox": [
            0.125,
            0.828,
            0.699,
            0.857
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Observe the image of a distant object, say a distant tree, in a plane mirror.",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 14,
          "bbox": [
            0.126,
            0.857,
            0.446,
            0.873
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "n "
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Could you see a full-length image?",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
